/a></span>. <i>Comparative Literature Studies</i>. <b>45</b> (1): <span class=\"nowrap\">62–</span>73. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1353%2Fcls.0.0012\">10.1353/cls.0.0012</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/JSTOR_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"JSTOR (identifier)\">JSTOR</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.jstor.org/stable/25659633\">25659633</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"S2CID (identifier)\">S2CID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:161117217\">161117217</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Comparative+Literature+Studies&amp;rft.atitle=De-Exoticizing+Haruki+Murakami%27s+Reception&amp;rft.volume=45&amp;rft.issue=1&amp;rft.pages=62-73&amp;rft.date=2008&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A161117217%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstor.org%2Fstable%2F25659633%23id-name%3DJSTOR&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1353%2Fcls.0.0012&amp;rft.aulast=Chozick&amp;rft.aufirst=Matthew+Richard&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstor.org%2Fstable%2F25659633&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AKafka+on+the+Shore\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>"}}